        "Satisfactory, if all the values observed are ≤ m; Acceptable, if a maximum of c values are between m and M and the rest of the values are observed as ≤m; Unsatisfactory, if one or more of the values observed are > M or more than prescribed c values are >m"^^xsd:string,
